<section id="admin-users-content" data-live-region class="dm-wrap dm-section"><h1 class="admin-page-heading"><%= ui_icon(:users) %>Usuários e permissões</h1><p>Administradores gerais gerenciam os dois ambientes. Editores acessam somente o ambiente atribuído.</p>
<details class="dm-panel"><summary>Criar usuário</summary><%= form_with url: admin_users_path, scope: :user, class: "dm-form" do |f| %><%= f.label :email, "E-mail" %><%= f.email_field :email, required: true, autocomplete: "off" %><%= f.label :password, "Senha inicial (mínimo de 12 caracteres)" %><%= f.password_field :password, required: true, minlength: 12, autocomplete: "new-password" %><%= f.label :editor_environment, "Ambiente do editor" %><%= f.select :editor_environment, [["Sem acesso editorial", ""], ["Jornal DM", "dm"], ["FECT", "fect"]] %><%= f.submit "Criar usuário", class: "dm-button" %><% end %></details>
<% @users.each do |user| %><article class="dm-panel"><h2><%= user.email %></h2><%= form_with model: user, url: admin_user_path(user), class: "dm-form" do |f| %><label><%= f.check_box :admin %> Administrador geral</label><%= f.label :editor_environment, "Ambiente do editor" %><%= f.select :editor_environment, [["Sem acesso editorial", ""], ["Jornal DM", "dm"], ["FECT", "fect"]] %><%= f.submit "Salvar permissões", class: "dm-button" %><% end %></article><% end %></section>
